  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco presents the Freedom &amp; Liberty T-Shirt. Fly your American flag high and show your patriotic spirit with our Freedom &amp; Liberty T-Shirt! Whether you&rsquo;re relaxing with family and friends, hiking on a local trail, fishing, or camping, this shirt makes a statement: It&rsquo;s your life, your liberty, and your pursuit of happiness!</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133330",
  "description": "<p>Rothco presents the Freedom &amp; Liberty T-Shirt. Fly your American flag high and show your patriotic spirit with our Freedom &amp; Liberty T-Shirt! Whether you&rsquo;re relaxing with family and friends, hiking on a local trail, fishing, or camping, this shirt makes a statement: It&rsquo;s your life, your liberty, and your pursuit of happiness!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>American Traditional:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Display your American pride like a U.S. sailor with bright, bold colors! The t-shirt&rsquo;s graphic design is inspired by the beauty, strength, and independence of the American Bald Eagle. Capture the essence that&rsquo;s home of the brave, and land of the free!</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Reliable and Durable Material:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Go ahead and wear your Freedom &amp; Liberty T-Shirt outside without a worry! These tough t-shirts consist of reinforced seams at the collar and sleeves, along with a tag-less neck label sewn in for comfort and convenience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Standard Fit:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Our Freedom &amp; Liberty T-Shirts are a preshrunk, standard fit, which gives you adequate room and flexibility for various outdoor activities. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Good Ol&rsquo; Red White &amp; Blue:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strut your stuff in classic red, white, and blue! Our Freedom &amp; Liberty T-Shirts are perfect for exhibiting national pride, especially during 4th of July, Memorial Day, and Veterans Day.</li>\n</ul>",
